  "description": {
   "en": "A historical Eastern romance where Beom-yoon, a younger man walking a blood-stained royal road, ascends to the untouchable position of emperor, seeking to possess Cheong-hee, an older woman. Based on the original work by Chomchom.\n\nBeom-yoon, a prince of Goyeon with the destiny of a Yaksha, enters an arranged marriage with Cheong-hee, who is fated to be an exorcist and used as a living amulet.\n\n\"Do you pity me, Your Highness?\"\n\n\"You'd better receive my respect while I treat you with honor...\""
  },
